{"id":"costilla","lemma":"costilla","pos":"noun","rank":3194,"glosses":["rib","a type of biscuit or cookie filled with jam"],"ipa":"/kosˈtiʝa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"costillas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-costilla.wav","examples":[{"text":"Me he roto una costilla.","en":"I just cracked a rib.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454905","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"broken"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Él se rompió dos costillas y se perforó el pulmón.","en":"He broke two ribs and punctured his lung.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689372","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to break","l":"romper"},{"g":"dung, excrement"},null,{"g":"and"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to puncture","l":"perforar"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"lung"}]},{"text":"Tom se cayó del techo y se rompió tres costillas.","en":"Tom fell off the roof and broke three ribs.","words":[null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"of the"},{"g":"ceiling"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to break","l":"romper"},{"g":"three"},null]},{"text":"Tom se cayó de techo y se quebró tres costillas.","en":"Tom fell off the roof and broke three ribs.","words":[null,{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to fall","l":"caer"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"ceiling"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to break","l":"quebrar"},{"g":"three"},null]}]}